WEBVTT

﻿1

00:01:12.323 --> 00:01:14.576
<i>This is Berk...</i>


00:01:14.743 --> 00:01:18.830
<i>the best-kept secret this
side of, well, anywhere.</i>


00:01:19.748 --> 00:01:22.917
<i>Granted, it may not look like much,
but this wet heap of rock...</i>


00:01:23.084 --> 00:01:26.129
<i>packs more than a few surprises.</i>


00:01:30.967 --> 00:01:35.472
<i>Life here is amazing, just
not for the faint of heart.</i>


00:01:35.638 --> 00:01:37.866
<i>You see, where most
folks enjoy hobbies</i>


00:01:37.891 --> 00:01:39.851
<i>like whittling or needlepoint...</i>


00:01:40.018 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>we Berkians prefer...</i>


00:01:43.313 --> 00:01:45.565
<i>a little something
we like to call...</i>


00:01:47.901 --> 00:01:49.736
<i>dragon racing!</i>


00:01:56.534 --> 00:01:58.036
Whoo!


00:02:02.499 --> 00:02:04.726
Whoa!


00:02:04.751 --> 00:02:08.146
I'm sorry, Fishlegs.
Did you want that?


00:02:09.672 --> 00:02:11.883
Snotlout, that was mine!


00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:13.259
Here you go, babe.


00:02:13.635 --> 00:02:15.011
Did I tell you that you
look amazing today...


00:02:15.178 --> 00:02:16.304
because you do.


00:02:16.513 --> 00:02:19.224
Come on, Barf. It's
starting to stink around here.


00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:21.184
Nope.
Still hates you.


00:02:21.351 --> 00:02:23.561
Let's blow this place, Belch!


00:02:24.145 --> 00:02:25.563
All right!


00:02:31.027 --> 00:02:32.904
Yeah!


00:02:33.404 --> 00:02:35.990
Ha-ha! That's nine
for the Twins...


00:02:36.282 --> 00:02:38.243
Astrid lags with three.


00:02:38.409 --> 00:02:42.247
Fishlegs and Snotlout
trail with none.


00:02:42.413 --> 00:02:43.873
And Hiccup is...


00:02:45.166 --> 00:02:47.252
nowhere to be found.


00:02:47.752 --> 00:02:51.381
Scared him off with the big
talk, didn't you, Stoick?


00:02:52.882 --> 00:02:54.092
What are you doing, Snotlout?


00:02:54.342 --> 00:02:55.635
They're gonna win now.


00:02:55.802 --> 00:02:58.179
She's my princess. Whatever
she wants, she gets.


00:02:58.346 --> 00:03:01.349
Ruffnut? Didn't she
try to bury you alive?


00:03:01.516 --> 00:03:02.756
Only for a few hours.


00:03:05.186 --> 00:03:09.023
<i>Now, dragons used to
be a bit of a problem here...</i>


00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:10.483
<i>but that was 5 years ago.</i>


00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:12.585
<i>Now, they have all moved in.</i>


00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:14.821
<i>And really, why wouldn't they?</i>


00:03:14.988 --> 00:03:16.781
<i>We have custom stables...</i>


00:03:16.948 --> 00:03:18.992
<i>all-you-can-eat
feeding stations...</i>


00:03:19.158 --> 00:03:21.494
<i>a full-service
dragon wash...</i>


00:03:23.079 --> 00:03:26.833
<i>even top-of-the-line fire
prevention if I do say so myself.</i>


00:03:28.167 --> 00:03:29.544
It's time, Gobber.


00:03:29.711 --> 00:03:31.296
Righty-ho.
Last lap!


00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:37.927
The Black Sheep!
Come on, Stormfly.


00:03:38.094 --> 00:03:39.904
We can still win this thing!


00:03:42.181 --> 00:03:43.821
- Come on, Barf!
- Let's go!


00:03:44.601 --> 00:03:45.602
Go, Meatlug!


00:03:46.394 --> 00:03:47.620
Whoo-hoo!


00:03:47.645 --> 00:03:49.439
Let's go!
Let's go! Let's go!


00:03:50.398 --> 00:03:51.858
This is your big moment.


00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:53.943
Have a nice flight!


00:03:57.322 --> 00:03:58.323
Up, up, up!


00:04:01.951 --> 00:04:03.119
- No!
- Yes!


00:04:03.286 --> 00:04:04.746
Good job, Meatlug.


00:04:05.705 --> 00:04:08.124
Here you go, darling.
Mine is worth ten.


00:04:08.666 --> 00:04:10.209
Yeah!
The Black Sheep!


00:04:11.878 --> 00:04:13.838
You guys are
fighting for Ruffnut?


00:04:14.005 --> 00:04:15.173
I'm totally winning!


00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:17.467
We're winning together!


00:04:17.926 --> 00:04:18.968
No!


00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:23.139
Whoo! No one can
stop me now!


00:04:23.306 --> 00:04:25.808
Except for me. We're
attached, genius.


00:04:25.975 --> 00:04:28.478
Quit trying to steal all my glory!
Hey!


00:04:29.562 --> 00:04:30.605
Get them, Astrid!


00:04:30.813 --> 00:04:31.956
It's my glory!


00:04:31.981 --> 00:04:33.066
Always ruining everything!


00:04:33.232 --> 00:04:34.312
No sheep, no glory!


00:04:34.317 --> 00:04:36.194
Gotcha!


00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:38.112
Whoa!
Astrid!


00:04:38.279 --> 00:04:40.782
Well played!


00:04:40.907 --> 00:04:43.618
That's my future daughter-in-law!


00:04:47.622 --> 00:04:49.457
Excuse me.
Stormfly!


00:04:53.461 --> 00:04:55.146
Whoa!


00:05:01.886 --> 00:05:05.365
That's 13!
Astrid takes the game!


00:05:07.433 --> 00:05:10.436
<i>Yep,
Berk is pretty much perfect.</i>


00:05:10.603 --> 00:05:12.063
<i>All of my hard
work has paid off.</i>


00:05:12.438 --> 00:05:14.123
<i>And it's a good thing, too,</i>


00:05:14.148 --> 00:05:15.750
<i>because with Vikings on
the backs of dragons...</i>


00:05:15.775 --> 00:05:17.215
Whoo-hoo!


00:05:17.235 --> 00:05:19.612
<i>...the world just got
a whole lot bigger.</i>


00:05:36.879 --> 00:05:37.922
Yeah!


00:05:40.842 --> 00:05:42.527
<i>Let the wind carry us</i>


00:05:42.552 --> 00:05:45.430
<i>To the clouds,
hurry up, all right</i>


00:05:47.682 --> 00:05:49.409
<i>We can travel so far</i>


00:05:49.434 --> 00:05:53.104
<i>As our eyes can see</i>


00:05:54.522 --> 00:06:00.486
<i>We go where no one goes</i>


00:06:01.362 --> 00:06:05.258
<i>We slow for no one</i>


00:06:05.283 --> 00:06:10.538
<i>Get out of our way...</i>


00:06:20.465 --> 00:06:22.091
So what do you think, bud?


00:06:22.258 --> 00:06:23.843
You wanna give
this another shot?


00:06:25.053 --> 00:06:27.013
Toothless!
It will be fine.


00:06:30.349 --> 00:06:31.476
Ready?


00:06:38.357 --> 00:06:40.526
Yeah!


00:06:44.447 --> 00:06:45.990
Yeah!


00:07:24.946 --> 00:07:27.156
This is amazing!


00:07:27.532 --> 00:07:29.158
No longer amazing!


00:07:29.283 --> 00:07:30.343
Toothless!


00:07:33.162 --> 00:07:34.247
No!


00:07:39.877 --> 00:07:42.296
Whoa!


00:07:52.306 --> 00:07:53.307
Whoo!


00:07:54.016 --> 00:07:56.310
That really came out of nowhere.


00:08:02.525 --> 00:08:05.987
We have to work on your
solo gliding there, bud.


00:08:06.154 --> 00:08:07.572
That locked-up tail...


00:08:07.738 --> 00:08:11.117
makes for some pretty sloppy
rescue maneuvers, hey?


00:08:28.968 --> 00:08:31.345
Looks like we
found another one, bud.


00:08:35.683 --> 00:08:38.477
What, do you want an apology?


00:08:38.644 --> 00:08:41.647
Is that why you're
pouting, big baby boo?


00:08:41.772 --> 00:08:44.692
Well, try this on!


00:08:45.484 --> 00:08:47.695
You feeling it yet?


00:08:47.862 --> 00:08:51.073
Picking up on all of my
heartfelt remorse?


00:08:53.451 --> 00:08:54.493
Come on, come on.


00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:57.371
You wouldn't hurt a
one-legged...


00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:02.185
You're right! You're right!
You win. You win.


00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:04.353
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!


00:09:04.378 --> 00:09:06.297
He's down.
And it's ugly.


00:09:06.464 --> 00:09:09.300
Dragons and Vikings,
enemies again...


00:09:09.467 --> 00:09:12.511
locked in combat
to the bitter...


00:09:19.393 --> 00:09:21.287
You know that doesn't wash out.


00:09:46.379 --> 00:09:48.339
So, what should we name it?


00:09:49.215 --> 00:09:51.175
"Itchy Armpit" it is.


00:09:52.593 --> 00:09:53.886
What do you reckon, bud?


00:09:54.053 --> 00:09:57.223
Think we might find a few
Timberjacks in those woods?


00:09:57.390 --> 00:09:59.642
The odd Whispering Death
or two in the rocks?


00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:05.898
Who knows? Maybe we'll finally
track down another Night Fury.


00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:09.193
Wouldn't that be something?


00:10:10.027 --> 00:10:12.880
So, what do you say?
Just keep going?


00:10:22.581 --> 00:10:24.208
Afternoon, milady.


00:10:24.625 --> 00:10:26.143
Where have you been?


00:10:26.168 --> 00:10:28.212
Hi.


00:10:28.713 --> 00:10:31.924
Winning races, what else?


00:10:32.091 --> 00:10:33.718
The real question is...


00:10:33.884 --> 00:10:34.969
where have you been?


00:10:35.136 --> 00:10:36.387
Avoiding my dad.


00:10:36.554 --> 00:10:38.222
No.
What happened now?


00:10:38.431 --> 00:10:40.474
You're gonna love this.


00:10:40.641 --> 00:10:42.810
I wake up.
The sun is shining.


00:10:42.977 --> 00:10:45.646
Terrible Terrors are
singing on the rooftop.


00:10:45.813 --> 00:10:47.106
I saunter down to breakfast...


00:10:47.273 --> 00:10:49.483
thinking all is right
with the world and I get...


00:10:50.026 --> 00:10:51.944
"Son, we need to talk."


00:10:52.194 --> 00:10:54.297
"Not now, Dad.
I got a whole day"


00:10:54.322 --> 00:10:56.365
"of goofing off to get
started."


00:10:56.532 --> 00:10:59.243
Okay, first of all,
I don't sound like that.


00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:00.828
Who is this character?


00:11:00.995 --> 00:11:04.915
And second, what is that thing
you're doing with my shoulders?


00:11:05.082 --> 00:11:08.169
Yeah, that's a truly
flattering impersonation.


00:11:08.336 --> 00:11:10.046
Anyway. he goes...


00:11:10.629 --> 00:11:13.841
"You're the pride of
Berk, son, and I couldn't be prouder."


00:11:14.008 --> 00:11:15.509
"Aw, thanks, Dad."


00:11:15.676 --> 00:11:18.262
"I'm pretty impressed
with myself, too."


00:11:18.512 --> 00:11:21.223
When have I ever
done that with my hands?


00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:22.933
You just did.


00:11:23.517 --> 00:11:26.729
Okay.
Just hold still.


00:11:27.605 --> 00:11:29.357
This is very serious.


00:11:32.109 --> 00:11:33.402
"You're all grown up..."


00:11:33.569 --> 00:11:36.364
"and since no chief could ask
for a better successor..."


00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:37.631
"I've decided..."


00:11:37.656 --> 00:11:38.908
To make you chief!


00:11:39.075 --> 00:11:41.927
My gods!
Hiccup, that's amazing!


00:11:43.245 --> 00:11:45.264
You're gonna wear
out the spring coil.


00:11:45.289 --> 00:11:47.391
The calibration
is very sensitive.


00:11:52.296 --> 00:11:53.881
Yeah...


00:11:55.007 --> 00:11:57.301
so this is what
I'm dealing with.


00:11:57.468 --> 00:11:58.469
What did you tell him?


00:11:58.636 --> 00:12:02.365
I didn't. By the time he
turned around, I was gone.


00:12:02.390 --> 00:12:04.283
Well,


00:12:04.308 --> 00:12:06.310
it's a lot of responsibility.


00:12:06.477 --> 00:12:09.897
The map will have
to wait for sure...


00:12:10.064 --> 00:12:11.457
and I'll need to fly Toothless,


00:12:11.482 --> 00:12:12.900
since you'll be too busy, but...


00:12:16.654 --> 00:12:18.531
It's not me, Astrid.


00:12:18.697 --> 00:12:21.008
All those speeches and planning,


00:12:21.033 --> 00:12:23.369
and running the village,
that's his thing.


00:12:23.536 --> 00:12:25.371
I think you're
missing the point.


00:12:25.538 --> 00:12:28.416
I mean, "chief."
What an honor.


00:12:28.582 --> 00:12:30.709
I'd be pretty excited.
I...


00:12:31.419 --> 00:12:33.045
I'm not like you.


00:12:33.212 --> 00:12:35.172
You know exactly who you are.


00:12:35.339 --> 00:12:37.133
You always have.


00:12:38.217 --> 00:12:39.844
But I'm still looking.


00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:42.346
I know that I'm not my father...


00:12:42.513 --> 00:12:45.141
and I never met my mother...


00:12:45.975 --> 00:12:47.768
so what does that make me?


00:12:53.232 --> 00:12:57.361
What you're searching for
isn't out there, Hiccup.


00:12:57.778 --> 00:12:59.321
It's in here.


00:13:00.406 --> 00:13:02.491
Maybe you just don't see it yet.


00:13:03.534 --> 00:13:04.994
Maybe.


00:13:05.327 --> 00:13:07.037
But you know...


00:13:07.204 --> 00:13:09.665
there is something out there.


00:13:09.832 --> 00:13:11.667
Hiccup...


00:13:40.988 --> 00:13:42.323
Whoa!


00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:47.536
Stay close.


00:14:00.257 --> 00:14:01.759
What happened here?


00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:10.201
All right, easy, bud.


00:14:10.226 --> 00:14:11.602
Hiccup!


00:14:12.228 --> 00:14:13.229
Fire!


00:14:13.437 --> 00:14:14.480
Astrid, look out!


00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:19.318
Hiccup!


00:14:24.323 --> 00:14:26.450
Watch the tail!


00:14:27.409 --> 00:14:29.161
Tie those legs up!


00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:33.707
Is that what I think it is?


00:14:33.874 --> 00:14:34.875
Stop!


00:14:35.042 --> 00:14:36.502
Stormfly!


00:14:37.711 --> 00:14:39.129
What are you doing?


00:14:40.464 --> 00:14:41.565
Whoa!


00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:42.675
Back again?


00:14:44.301 --> 00:14:46.387
Soil my britches.


00:14:46.554 --> 00:14:49.098
That is a Night Fury.


00:14:49.265 --> 00:14:51.350
I thought they were
all gone for good.


00:14:51.767 --> 00:14:54.144
It looks like our luck's had
a turn for the better, lads.


00:14:54.311 --> 00:14:56.480
Don't think Drago
has one of those...


00:14:57.064 --> 00:14:58.190
in his dragon army.


00:14:58.357 --> 00:14:59.817
Dragon army?


00:14:59.984 --> 00:15:01.652
Look, we don't want any trouble.


00:15:01.819 --> 00:15:02.962
Ha!


00:15:02.987 --> 00:15:04.755
You should have thought of that


00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:06.448
before you stole
all of our dragons...


00:15:06.615 --> 00:15:08.801
and blasted our fort to bits!


00:15:10.744 --> 00:15:12.079
What are you talking about?


00:15:12.246 --> 00:15:13.956
You think we did this?


00:15:14.415 --> 00:15:17.434
Dragon trapping
is hard enough work


00:15:17.459 --> 00:15:19.920
as it is without
do-gooder dragon riders...


00:15:20.087 --> 00:15:21.714
sneaking in to rescue them.


00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:23.591
What do-gooder?


00:15:24.425 --> 00:15:26.594
There are other dragon riders?


00:15:26.927 --> 00:15:28.737
You mean other than your
thieving friend from last night?


00:15:28.762 --> 00:15:29.763
You tell me.


00:15:30.431 --> 00:15:32.850
You may have an ice-spitting
dragon on your side...


00:15:33.684 --> 00:15:35.603
but we still have
a quota to fill.


00:15:35.769 --> 00:15:38.897
How do you suppose we explain
this mess to Drago Bludvist?


00:15:39.064 --> 00:15:42.526
Drago what-fist? Does
anything you say make sense?


00:15:42.693 --> 00:15:46.655
He's expecting a new shipment of
dragons for his army by tomorrow.


00:15:46.822 --> 00:15:50.200
And Drago don't
take well to excuses.


00:15:50.367 --> 00:15:52.036
This is what he gave me...


00:15:52.202 --> 00:15:54.455
last time I showed up
empty-handed.


00:15:54.622 --> 00:15:58.083
He promised to be far less
understanding in the future.


00:15:58.751 --> 00:16:01.295
All right, look, we don't know
anything about a dragon thief...


00:16:01.462 --> 00:16:02.838
or an ice-spitting
dragon...


00:16:03.297 --> 00:16:07.176
or your lunatic boss
and his dragon army, okay?


00:16:07.343 --> 00:16:10.137
Just give us back our
dragon and we'll go...


00:16:10.304 --> 00:16:12.931
strange, hostile person
whom we've never met.


00:16:13.098 --> 00:16:14.975
Where are my manners?


00:16:15.517 --> 00:16:16.518
I'm Eret...


00:16:16.935 --> 00:16:18.562
son of Eret.


00:16:19.313 --> 00:16:21.899
Finest dragon trapper alive.


00:16:22.608 --> 00:16:23.609
After all,


00:16:24.193 --> 00:16:27.321
it's not just anyone who
can capture a Night Fury.


00:16:27.905 --> 00:16:31.800
And this is Toothless.
He says we're going. Now.


00:16:33.494 --> 00:16:34.745
They all say that.


00:16:34.912 --> 00:16:36.872
Rush 'em, lads!


00:16:43.087 --> 00:16:44.088
Stormfly!
Come on!


00:16:44.296 --> 00:16:45.297
Go! Go!


00:16:49.677 --> 00:16:52.096
You will never hold on
to those dragons...


00:16:52.262 --> 00:16:53.514
you hear me?


00:16:53.681 --> 00:16:56.350
Drago is coming for them all!


00:16:59.311 --> 00:17:01.372
- Come on, Meatlug!
Whoo-hoo!


00:17:01.397 --> 00:17:02.623
Yahoo!


00:17:04.817 --> 00:17:06.402
Whoa!


00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:12.341
Hey, there, Stoick!


00:17:12.366 --> 00:17:13.784
Hey, how are you?
Beautiful day.


00:17:13.951 --> 00:17:16.245
Hello, Spitelout. Great race.


00:17:16.412 --> 00:17:17.913
Sorry, Mrs. Ack.


00:17:18.038 --> 00:17:19.098
Any sign of him?


00:17:19.123 --> 00:17:22.626
He's probably flown off
the edge of the world by now.


00:17:22.793 --> 00:17:24.962
Are you sure you want that
kid running the village?


00:17:25.129 --> 00:17:27.089
You can still
delay your retirement.


00:17:27.256 --> 00:17:29.842
He's ready. You'll see.


00:17:30.426 --> 00:17:33.011
There he is!


00:17:33.846 --> 00:17:36.432
The pride of Berk!


00:17:36.598 --> 00:17:39.601
Who finally decided
to show up for work. Yay.


00:17:39.768 --> 00:17:41.395
Sorry. Got held up.


00:17:41.562 --> 00:17:42.771
Hey, Dad, could I have a word?


00:17:42.938 --> 00:17:44.982
Something you're
itching to tell me?


00:17:45.149 --> 00:17:47.735
Not quite the itch you're
thinking of, but yes.


00:17:47.901 --> 00:17:50.779
Good man!
Now, lesson one.


00:17:50.946 --> 00:17:54.032
A chief's first duty is
to his people, so... 41?


00:17:54.199 --> 00:17:56.243
Can we just talk in private?
Forty...


00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:58.620
That's me! That's me! I'm next!


00:17:58.787 --> 00:18:00.080
If we could just talk...


00:18:00.247 --> 00:18:02.082
Excuse me.
I have been here all day.


00:18:02.249 --> 00:18:04.710
Okay, okay. I want one
of those high seaters...


00:18:04.877 --> 00:18:08.213
with lots of spikes and a
big stowage compartment.


00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:10.299
Absolutely.
You got it, sir.


00:18:10.466 --> 00:18:12.192
Dad, this is actually
a little more important


00:18:12.217 --> 00:18:13.260
than building saddles.


00:18:13.427 --> 00:18:15.612
Lesson two.
No task is too small


00:18:15.637 --> 00:18:17.514
when it comes to
serving your people.


00:18:17.681 --> 00:18:19.241
Excuse us, Grump.


00:18:19.266 --> 00:18:20.267
Dad, can we just talk...


00:18:20.434 --> 00:18:21.602
Grump!


00:18:21.769 --> 00:18:23.687
You let the forge
die down again!


00:18:29.818 --> 00:18:32.613
That's it, Grump.
You're going up for adoption.


00:18:32.863 --> 00:18:35.240
There you go.
Go on. Have away.


00:18:35.699 --> 00:18:37.885
Seriously, I really
need to tell you


00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:39.953
about this new
land we came across.


00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.789
Another one?
Any new dragons?


00:18:41.955 --> 00:18:43.791
We didn't stick
around to find out.


00:18:43.957 --> 00:18:46.919
These folks weren't
particularly friendly.


00:18:47.795 --> 00:18:49.980
Really? Your Night
Fury and Deadly Nadder


00:18:50.005 --> 00:18:51.840
didn't bring them
cheering to the rooftops?


00:18:52.007 --> 00:18:53.509
No, this was different.


00:18:53.675 --> 00:18:56.804
Not the standard run-for-the-hills
hoo-ha I've come to enjoy.


00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:59.473
These guys were trappers.


00:18:59.932 --> 00:19:01.475
Dragon trappers.


00:19:01.642 --> 00:19:02.882
You should have seen their fort.


00:19:02.893 --> 00:19:07.189
All blown apart and stuck in giant
spikes of ice. It was weird!


00:19:07.356 --> 00:19:09.274
I've never seen
anything like it.


00:19:09.441 --> 00:19:11.485
And worst of all,
they thought we did it!


00:19:11.652 --> 00:19:13.796
You two are gonna get yourselves


00:19:13.821 --> 00:19:15.864
in serious trouble
one of these days.


00:19:16.031 --> 00:19:18.700
Not everyone appreciates
this way of life.


00:19:19.159 --> 00:19:20.494
Aye, Gobber's right, son.


00:19:20.661 --> 00:19:21.912
Best we keep to our own.


00:19:22.079 --> 00:19:25.082
Besides, you'll have more
important uses for your time.


00:19:27.167 --> 00:19:29.753
Once we make
the big announcement!


00:19:30.629 --> 00:19:33.173
They are building a dragon army.


00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:37.469
Or at least
the guy they work for is.


00:19:38.011 --> 00:19:40.639
Dargo Bloody Fist, or something.


00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:46.603
I'll bloody his fist with my face
if he tries to take my dragon!


00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:47.771
Or mine!


00:19:48.021 --> 00:19:49.439
You're such a moron.


00:19:49.606 --> 00:19:50.691
A beautiful moron.


00:19:50.816 --> 00:19:52.234
Yeah.


00:19:52.651 --> 00:19:55.404
Bludvist?
Drago Bludvist?


00:19:55.571 --> 00:19:57.239
Yeah. Wait.


00:19:57.739 --> 00:19:58.907
You know him?


00:20:01.952 --> 00:20:03.011
Ground all dragons!


00:20:03.036 --> 00:20:04.096
What? Why?


00:20:04.121 --> 00:20:05.455
Seal the gates!


00:20:05.831 --> 00:20:07.140
Lower the storm doors!


00:20:07.165 --> 00:20:08.433
Wait! What is happening?


00:20:08.458 --> 00:20:09.476
Come on!


00:20:09.501 --> 00:20:10.878
You heard the man!
Lock it down.


00:20:13.547 --> 00:20:17.634
No dragon or Viking sets foot
off this island until I give the word!


00:20:17.801 --> 00:20:20.041
Wait, because some guy you
knew is stirring up trouble...


00:20:20.178 --> 00:20:21.638
in some faraway land?


00:20:21.805 --> 00:20:23.974
Because Drago Bludvist
is a madman...


00:20:24.141 --> 00:20:26.310
without conscience or mercy.


00:20:26.476 --> 00:20:31.023
And if he's built a dragon
army, gods help us all.


00:20:31.189 --> 00:20:32.858
Get them into their pens!
Quickly!


00:20:33.025 --> 00:20:34.860
Then, let's ride back out there.


00:20:35.027 --> 00:20:37.087
We'll follow those
trappers to Drago


00:20:37.112 --> 00:20:38.363
and talk some sense into him.


00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:40.324
No. We fortify the island.


00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:42.034
It's our duty to keep the peace!


00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:45.579
Peace is over, Hiccup.
I must prepare you for war.


00:20:45.746 --> 00:20:46.788
War?


00:20:46.955 --> 00:20:49.458
Dad, if Drago is
coming for our dragons...


00:20:49.625 --> 00:20:52.002
we can't wait around
for him to get here.


00:20:52.169 --> 00:20:55.213
Let's go find him
and change his mind.


00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:57.424
No, some minds won't
be changed, Hiccup.


00:20:57.591 --> 00:20:59.843
Berk is what you
need to worry about.


00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:02.387
A chief protects his own.


00:21:03.847 --> 00:21:06.350
Secure the stables!
Latch every stall!


00:21:06.516 --> 00:21:08.435
Hiccup, don't!
I have to.


00:21:08.602 --> 00:21:09.645
This way!


00:21:09.811 --> 00:21:11.021
Quickly!


00:21:12.731 --> 00:21:14.333
Hiccup!


00:21:16.026 --> 00:21:17.069
Come on!


00:21:18.737 --> 00:21:20.405
Hiccup!


00:21:30.791 --> 00:21:32.918
Keep your eyes peeled, lads!


00:21:33.085 --> 00:21:35.796
With this wind, we'll reach
Drago by daybreak...


00:21:35.963 --> 00:21:39.508
so best we fill this ship up
with dragons, and quick!


00:21:39.675 --> 00:21:41.218
It's no time to be picky.


00:21:41.385 --> 00:21:42.636
Eret?


00:21:42.761 --> 00:21:44.012
Not if we want to keep our...


00:21:45.389 --> 00:21:48.433
...heads!
Off the port quarter!


00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:50.811
Net them, lads!
Take them down!


00:21:54.898 --> 00:21:56.400
You're not
getting away this time.


00:21:56.942 --> 00:21:57.943
Fire!


00:21:59.194 --> 00:22:00.612
Reload!


00:22:00.779 --> 00:22:02.447
Reload! Incoming!


00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:06.201
And here I was...


00:22:06.368 --> 00:22:08.537
worried we might
turn up empty-handed.


00:22:08.704 --> 00:22:10.555
Nope.
It's your lucky day.


00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:12.249
We give up.


00:22:13.875 --> 00:22:17.754
That's one Night Fury,
one Deadly Nadder...


00:22:17.921 --> 00:22:20.924
and two of the finest
dragon riders west of Luk Tuk.


00:22:21.216 --> 00:22:23.443
That ought to make
the boss happy, right?


00:22:23.468 --> 00:22:25.262
Excuse us.


00:22:25.429 --> 00:22:26.488
What are you doing?


00:22:26.513 --> 00:22:28.432
Toothless, stay.


00:22:29.808 --> 00:22:32.577
The dragons don't
care for cramped spaces,


00:22:32.602 --> 00:22:34.104
so they'll just
hang out with you.


00:22:34.271 --> 00:22:35.914
They won't be any trouble.


00:22:37.315 --> 00:22:39.026
Unless you do that.


00:22:39.192 --> 00:22:43.196
You know, wooden boat, big ocean.
How is your swimming?


00:22:43.363 --> 00:22:45.382
Not good.


00:22:46.616 --> 00:22:50.120
Oops! Almost forgot. You
can't have armed prisoners.


00:22:50.287 --> 00:22:51.872
How is this a plan?


00:22:52.039 --> 00:22:54.708
Just what every
dragon trapper needs.


00:22:54.875 --> 00:22:58.086
One end coats the blade
in Monstrous Nightmare saliva.


00:22:58.253 --> 00:23:00.964
The other sprays
Hideous Zippleback gas.


00:23:01.131 --> 00:23:03.859
All it takes is a spark, and...


00:23:05.969 --> 00:23:07.387
Yeah, there you go.


00:23:07.721 --> 00:23:09.656
Once they see you
as one of their own...


00:23:09.681 --> 00:23:11.892
even the testiest
dragons can be trained.


00:23:12.059 --> 00:23:13.118
Right, bud?


00:23:13.143 --> 00:23:15.062
Give me that!


00:23:16.063 --> 00:23:18.023
What game are you playing?


00:23:18.190 --> 00:23:20.292
No game.
We just wanna meet Drago.


00:23:20.317 --> 00:23:21.359
Why?


00:23:21.526 --> 00:23:24.463
Because I'm going to change
his mind about dragons.


00:23:27.991 --> 00:23:29.951
He can be really persuasive.


00:23:30.118 --> 00:23:31.453
Once you've
earned his loyalty...


00:23:31.620 --> 00:23:34.139
there is nothing
a dragon won't do for you.


00:23:34.164 --> 00:23:37.292
You won't be
changing any minds around here.


00:23:37.459 --> 00:23:38.835
I can change yours.


00:23:39.002 --> 00:23:40.921
Right here. Right now.


00:23:44.007 --> 00:23:45.050
May I?


00:23:49.763 --> 00:23:51.348
Dragon riders!


00:23:58.271 --> 00:23:59.356
Put me down!


00:23:59.523 --> 00:24:01.900
Snotlout, what are you doing?


00:24:02.067 --> 00:24:03.485
See how well I
protect and provide?


00:24:04.903 --> 00:24:05.987
What is with all the nets?


00:24:06.113 --> 00:24:07.614
Hey, watch it!
That was...


00:24:07.781 --> 00:24:10.200
close.


00:24:12.869 --> 00:24:15.247
My.


00:24:17.874 --> 00:24:20.252
Me likey.


00:24:23.713 --> 00:24:25.215
Take me.


00:24:29.094 --> 00:24:30.387
Hold your fire!


00:24:33.974 --> 00:24:36.935
What are you guys doing here?


00:24:37.102 --> 00:24:39.146
We're here to rescue you!


00:24:39.312 --> 00:24:40.856
I don't need to be rescued!


00:24:41.022 --> 00:24:42.315
Enough!


00:24:44.651 --> 00:24:48.071
Well, didn't you just
pick the wrong ship?


00:24:48.321 --> 00:24:50.824
I am Eret, son of Eret.


00:24:51.616 --> 00:24:53.577
I'm...


00:24:54.953 --> 00:24:57.164
Get this thing off me.


00:24:57.330 --> 00:24:58.748
Anyone else?


00:24:59.791 --> 00:25:00.792
That's what I figured.


00:25:00.959 --> 00:25:03.920
You, saddle up.
We're going home.


00:25:04.087 --> 00:25:05.130
No.


00:25:06.131 --> 00:25:07.841
Of all the irresponsible...


00:25:08.008 --> 00:25:10.802
I'm trying to protect our
dragons and stop a war!


00:25:10.969 --> 00:25:12.262
How is that irresponsible?


00:25:12.429 --> 00:25:14.806
Because war is
what he wants, son!


00:25:20.854 --> 00:25:23.440
Years ago, there was a great
gathering of chieftains...


00:25:23.607 --> 00:25:26.359
to discuss the dragon
scourge we all faced.


00:25:26.568 --> 00:25:30.822
<i>Into our midst came a stranger
from a strange land...</i>


00:25:30.989 --> 00:25:34.868
<i>covered in scars and draped
in a cloak of dragon skin.</i>


00:25:35.660 --> 00:25:37.829
<i>He carried no weapon...</i>


00:25:37.996 --> 00:25:40.415
<i>and spoke softly,
saying that he...</i>


00:25:41.124 --> 00:25:44.628
<i>Drago Bludvist,
was a man of the people...</i>


00:25:44.794 --> 00:25:48.798
<i>devoted to freeing mankind
from the tyranny of dragons.</i>


00:25:49.466 --> 00:25:51.593
<i>He claimed that he alone
could control the dragons...</i>


00:25:51.760 --> 00:25:55.096
<i>and that he alone
could keep us safe...</i>


00:25:56.014 --> 00:25:57.390
<i>if we chose to bow down...</i>


00:25:57.807 --> 00:25:59.809
<i>and follow him.</i>


00:26:02.437 --> 00:26:04.439
Stupid.
Good one.


00:26:04.606 --> 00:26:06.691
Aye, we laughed, too.


00:26:06.858 --> 00:26:09.611
<i>Until he wrapped himself in
his cloak and cried out...</i>


00:26:09.778 --> 00:26:12.489
<i>"Then see how well
you do without me!"</i>


00:26:13.531 --> 00:26:16.201
<i>The rooftop suddenly
burst into flames...</i>


00:26:16.368 --> 00:26:19.788
<i>and from it,
armored dragons descended...</i>


00:26:20.247 --> 00:26:22.249
<i>burning the hall to the ground.</i>


00:26:23.917 --> 00:26:24.918
I...


00:26:26.086 --> 00:26:28.672
was the only one to escape.


00:26:33.426 --> 00:26:37.180
Men who kill without reason
cannot be reasoned with.


00:26:37.347 --> 00:26:39.015
Maybe.
Hiccup!


00:26:39.182 --> 00:26:40.684
I'm still going to try.


00:26:43.270 --> 00:26:44.771
This is what I'm good at.


00:26:44.938 --> 00:26:47.607
And if I could
change your mind...


00:26:47.774 --> 00:26:49.484
I can change his, too.


00:26:51.027 --> 00:26:52.195
Come on.


00:26:53.571 --> 00:26:54.698
- Let's go.
- No!


00:26:54.864 --> 00:26:56.866
Lead the others back to Berk.


00:26:57.033 --> 00:26:59.160
I've had enough
mutiny for one day.


00:27:01.830 --> 00:27:04.207
I like that.


00:27:04.332 --> 00:27:05.392
Ruffnut!


00:27:05.417 --> 00:27:07.085
Okay!


00:27:26.688 --> 00:27:29.357
Don't worry, bud.


00:27:29.733 --> 00:27:32.193
I'm not gonna let
anything happen to you.


00:27:32.861 --> 00:27:34.571
I promise.


00:27:42.287 --> 00:27:43.830
Come on, Dad!


00:27:43.997 --> 00:27:45.290
Really?


00:27:53.673 --> 00:27:55.133
Okay.


00:27:55.842 --> 00:27:57.635
No sudden moves.


00:28:21.743 --> 00:28:23.286
Hold on. Hold on.


00:28:35.048 --> 00:28:36.508
Toothless!


00:29:25.890 --> 00:29:29.102
Hey! You left my
dragon back there!


00:29:29.269 --> 00:29:31.604
He can't fly on his own!
He will drown!


00:29:53.626 --> 00:29:54.627
Hey!


00:29:55.378 --> 00:29:57.797
We have to head
back for my dragon!


00:30:43.968 --> 00:30:45.428
Who are you?


00:30:46.429 --> 00:30:48.014
The dragon thief?


00:30:50.475 --> 00:30:51.976
Drago Bludvist?


00:30:53.353 --> 00:30:55.897
Do you even understand
what I'm saying?


00:31:03.321 --> 00:31:05.907
Toothless! It's okay,
it's okay, it's okay.


00:31:06.074 --> 00:31:08.034
I'm glad to see you, too, bud.


00:31:08.201 --> 00:31:10.662
You really had
me worried, there.


00:31:56.416 --> 00:31:57.625
Hiccup?


00:32:02.505 --> 00:32:04.132
Could it be?


00:32:05.174 --> 00:32:07.552
After all these years?


00:32:07.927 --> 00:32:09.637
How is this possible?


00:32:10.138 --> 00:32:11.264
Should I...


00:32:12.599 --> 00:32:13.933
Should I know you?


00:32:14.809 --> 00:32:17.562
No, you were only a babe.


00:32:23.067 --> 00:32:26.154
But a mother never forgets.


00:32:33.828 --> 00:32:35.121
Come.


00:32:36.080 --> 00:32:38.583
Boar-headed!
Just like his mother!


00:32:38.750 --> 00:32:40.585
Aye, she could
never stay put either.


00:32:40.752 --> 00:32:42.045
He's just twenty.


00:32:42.211 --> 00:32:44.839
And a Viking. Could there
be a worse combination?


00:32:45.882 --> 00:32:49.886
When I think of how stubborn and
senseless you were back in the day...


00:32:52.597 --> 00:32:54.932
Well, not much
has changed, actually.


00:32:55.933 --> 00:32:58.328
You know what he's like.


00:32:58.353 --> 00:33:00.063
He won't give up, Gobber.


00:33:00.897 --> 00:33:04.984
And if Hiccup finds Drago,
before we find him...


00:33:05.401 --> 00:33:06.694
Nothing can hurt Hiccup...


00:33:06.861 --> 00:33:10.239
so long as that Night Fury's around.
It's a Night Fury!


00:33:30.551 --> 00:33:31.552
Find them, Skullcrusher.


00:33:33.429 --> 00:33:35.682
Find them.


00:33:42.105 --> 00:33:43.690
Hold on.
Wait just a minute.


00:33:43.856 --> 00:33:44.957
This way!
Come back here!


00:33:44.982 --> 00:33:46.042
Come.


00:33:46.067 --> 00:33:49.112
You can't just say something
like that and run off!


00:33:49.320 --> 00:33:51.698
You're my mother?
I mean, what the...


00:33:52.198 --> 00:33:54.158
Do you grasp how
insane it sounds?


00:33:54.450 --> 00:33:55.468
Come, quickly!


00:33:55.493 --> 00:33:57.620
I have questions!


00:33:58.538 --> 00:34:00.498
Where have you
been all this time?


00:34:01.874 --> 00:34:03.710
What have you been doing?


00:34:04.377 --> 00:34:06.671
But they said you were dead!


00:34:06.838 --> 00:34:10.024
Everyone thinks
you were eaten by...


00:34:49.881 --> 00:34:52.967
This is where you've
been for 20 years?


00:34:56.095 --> 00:34:57.930
You've been rescuing them.


00:35:01.517 --> 00:35:02.602
Unbelievable.


00:35:02.769 --> 00:35:04.270
You're not upset?


00:35:04.437 --> 00:35:06.689
What? No.
I don't know.


00:35:06.856 --> 00:35:09.025
It's a bit much to get my
head around, to be frank.


00:35:09.192 --> 00:35:10.735
It's not every
day you find out...


00:35:10.902 --> 00:35:14.172
your mother is some
kind of crazy, feral,


00:35:14.197 --> 00:35:16.048
vigilante dragon lady.


00:35:19.786 --> 00:35:23.372
At least I'm not boring, right?


00:35:23.539 --> 00:35:28.211
I suppose there is
that one specific thing.


00:35:28.377 --> 00:35:30.421
Do you like it?


00:35:32.840 --> 00:35:34.509
I don't have the words.


00:35:43.684 --> 00:35:44.977
Can I...


00:35:45.561 --> 00:35:47.313
He's beautiful.


00:35:51.359 --> 00:35:53.027
Incredible!


00:35:54.195 --> 00:35:57.156
He might very well
be the last of his kind.


00:35:57.323 --> 00:36:00.034
And look, he's your age.


00:36:00.201 --> 00:36:01.344
Wow.


00:36:01.369 --> 00:36:03.221
No wonder you get along so well.


00:36:06.249 --> 00:36:09.293
And retractable teeth!


00:36:10.378 --> 00:36:11.813
How did you manage to...


00:36:11.838 --> 00:36:13.297
I found him in the woods.


00:36:13.464 --> 00:36:16.592
He was shot down and wounded.


00:36:20.847 --> 00:36:25.685
This Snafflefang lost his leg to one
of Drago Bludvist's iron traps.


00:36:26.102 --> 00:36:29.230
This Raincutter had her wing
sliced by razor netting.


00:36:29.647 --> 00:36:31.691
And this poor Hobblegrunt...


00:36:32.400 --> 00:36:34.819
was blinded by a tree snare...


00:36:34.986 --> 00:36:37.864
and then left to
die alone and scared.


00:36:38.948 --> 00:36:39.991
And what of this?


00:36:40.491 --> 00:36:43.094
Did Drago or his
trappers do this, too?


00:36:43.119 --> 00:36:45.580
Yeah...


00:36:47.123 --> 00:36:49.250
The crazy thing is...


00:36:49.917 --> 00:36:53.588
I'm actually the one
who shot him down.


00:36:54.255 --> 00:36:56.132
Hey, it's okay, though.


00:36:56.299 --> 00:36:57.425
He got me back!


00:36:57.592 --> 00:36:58.843
Right, bud?


00:36:59.010 --> 00:37:00.720
You couldn't save
all of me, could you?


00:37:00.887 --> 00:37:02.388
You just had to make it even.


00:37:02.555 --> 00:37:05.308
So, peg leg!


00:37:11.230 --> 00:37:14.275
What did your father think
of your Night Fury friend?


00:37:14.442 --> 00:37:16.652
He didn't take it all that well.


00:37:17.403 --> 00:37:20.031
But then he changed.


00:37:20.615 --> 00:37:22.533
They all did.


00:37:22.700 --> 00:37:25.494
Pretty soon, everyone back
home had dragons of their own.


00:37:26.370 --> 00:37:28.456
If only it were possible.
No, really.


00:37:28.623 --> 00:37:30.791
Believe me, I tried, as well...


00:37:30.958 --> 00:37:33.920
but people are not
capable of change, Hiccup.


00:37:34.462 --> 00:37:38.524
Some of us were
just born different.


00:37:42.094 --> 00:37:44.472
Hoist the torches!


00:37:45.806 --> 00:37:48.976
<i>Berk was a land of
"kill-or-be-killed"...</i>


00:37:49.143 --> 00:37:51.829
<i>but I believed
peace was possible.</i>


00:37:52.980 --> 00:37:55.691
Stop! You'll only
make it worse!


00:37:56.859 --> 00:37:59.503
<i>It was a very unpopular opinion.</i>


00:37:59.528 --> 00:38:01.739
Hiccup!


00:38:02.490 --> 00:38:06.410
<i>Then, one night, a
dragon broke into our house...</i>


00:38:06.577 --> 00:38:08.955
<i>finding you in the cradle.</i>


00:38:10.206 --> 00:38:12.350
<i>I rushed to protect you.</i>


00:38:17.004 --> 00:38:18.965
<i>But what I saw...</i>


00:38:19.131 --> 00:38:21.300
<i>was proof of
everything I believed.</i>


00:38:34.188 --> 00:38:36.649
<i>This wasn't a vicious beast...</i>


00:38:36.816 --> 00:38:39.735
<i>but an intelligent,
gentle creature...</i>


00:38:40.277 --> 00:38:41.487
<i>whose soul...</i>


00:38:41.654 --> 00:38:43.322
<i>reflected my own.</i>


00:38:45.449 --> 00:38:46.534
Valka, run!


00:38:46.701 --> 00:38:48.869
No! Don't!


00:38:53.207 --> 00:38:54.225
Hold on!


00:38:56.711 --> 00:38:58.212
No! Stoick!


00:38:58.379 --> 00:38:59.755
Valka!


00:39:01.507 --> 00:39:03.134
Stoick!


00:39:05.136 --> 00:39:06.345
Valka.


00:39:08.139 --> 00:39:11.600
You and your father
nearly died that night...


00:39:11.767 --> 00:39:14.687
all because I couldn't
kill a dragon.


00:39:15.563 --> 00:39:17.898
It runs in the family.


00:39:18.065 --> 00:39:20.484
It broke my heart
to stay away...


00:39:20.651 --> 00:39:23.529
but I believed you would
be safer if I did.


00:39:25.448 --> 00:39:26.574
How did you survive?


00:39:26.907 --> 00:39:29.660
Cloudjumper never
meant to harm me.


00:39:29.827 --> 00:39:33.039
He must have thought
I belonged here.


00:39:33.664 --> 00:39:37.918
In the home of
the great Bewilderbeast.


00:39:38.085 --> 00:39:40.421
The alpha species.


00:39:40.588 --> 00:39:43.716
One of the very
few that still exist.


00:39:46.385 --> 00:39:47.720
Every nest has its queen...


00:39:47.887 --> 00:39:51.807
but this is
the king of all dragons.


00:39:52.141 --> 00:39:56.562
With his icy breath, this
graceful giant built our nest.


00:39:56.771 --> 00:39:59.607
A safe haven for
dragons everywhere.


00:40:00.483 --> 00:40:02.610
Wait,
that's the ice-spitter?


00:40:02.777 --> 00:40:04.945
He's responsible for
all that destruction?


00:40:05.112 --> 00:40:06.947
He protects us.


00:40:07.448 --> 00:40:11.177
We all live under his care
and his command.


00:40:14.163 --> 00:40:16.582
All but the babies, of course...


00:40:19.043 --> 00:40:20.770
...who listen to no one!


00:40:34.558 --> 00:40:36.519
I've lived among them...


00:40:36.685 --> 00:40:38.145
for 20 years, Hiccup...


00:40:38.312 --> 00:40:39.480
discovering their secrets.


00:40:43.776 --> 00:40:45.778
He likes you.
Wow.


00:40:46.695 --> 00:40:48.364
You must be hungry.


00:40:48.531 --> 00:40:49.715
Yeah, I could eat.


00:40:49.740 --> 00:40:52.451
Good.
It's feeding time.


00:41:01.627 --> 00:41:03.045
I don't like it.


00:41:03.212 --> 00:41:04.755
They should have been
back with Hiccup by now.


00:41:04.922 --> 00:41:06.966
I don't like it either.
Eret, son of Eret...


00:41:07.133 --> 00:41:10.302
was the man of my dreams.
My everything!


00:41:10.469 --> 00:41:12.763
But, baby,
I grew facial hair for you.


00:41:13.222 --> 00:41:14.431
Me, too.


00:41:14.598 --> 00:41:16.392
What if Drago shot them down?


00:41:16.559 --> 00:41:18.853
What if they need our help?


00:41:19.311 --> 00:41:20.771
We have to find them.


00:41:20.938 --> 00:41:22.314
Wait, what?
No, but Stoick said...


00:41:22.481 --> 00:41:24.333
It doesn't matter what he said,


00:41:24.358 --> 00:41:25.558
if they have all been captured.


00:41:25.568 --> 00:41:26.569
Come on!


00:41:30.489 --> 00:41:31.699
Do we go back?


00:41:31.866 --> 00:41:34.827
We have nowhere to
go, nothing to sell...


00:41:35.077 --> 00:41:36.787
and no heads to call our own!


00:41:36.954 --> 00:41:40.416
If we don't turn up with
dragons, and fast...


00:41:41.876 --> 00:41:44.545
Careful what you wish for!


00:41:44.712 --> 00:41:46.213
Eret, son of Eret!


00:41:46.714 --> 00:41:48.591
What is this?
A kidnapping.


00:41:48.757 --> 00:41:51.694
- Yay! Can he ride with me?
- Can he? Can he?


00:41:53.012 --> 00:41:54.847
You're gonna show
us the way to Drago.


00:41:55.014 --> 00:41:59.185
And help dragon riders sneak into
Drago's camp? Just kill me now.


00:41:59.351 --> 00:42:01.954
That could be arranged.
Stormfly, drop it!


00:42:04.523 --> 00:42:05.900
Good girl!


00:42:06.483 --> 00:42:08.277
Stormfly, fetch!


00:42:09.111 --> 00:42:10.905
All right!


00:42:11.071 --> 00:42:13.949
Okay! I'll take
you to Drago!


00:42:16.660 --> 00:42:18.787
Works every time.


00:42:26.045 --> 00:42:28.339
Hey, I thought we
were going to eat.


00:42:28.505 --> 00:42:29.882
We are.


00:43:01.455 --> 00:43:03.040
Then, from Dragon Island...


00:43:03.207 --> 00:43:04.250
I found this archipelago.


00:43:11.507 --> 00:43:12.967
There.


00:43:13.467 --> 00:43:15.803
Whoa!


00:43:32.361 --> 00:43:34.446
Whoo-hoo!


00:44:05.394 --> 00:44:07.146
When I'm up here...


00:44:07.313 --> 00:44:10.566
I don't even feel the cold.
I just feel...


00:44:10.983 --> 00:44:12.276
Free.


00:44:15.696 --> 00:44:20.576
This is what it
is to be a dragon, Hiccup.


00:44:20.993 --> 00:44:23.954
It's all well and good
to call yourself a dragon...


00:44:24.121 --> 00:44:25.289
but can you fly?


00:44:46.810 --> 00:44:48.020
No!


00:44:56.070 --> 00:44:57.738
Ha!


00:44:59.156 --> 00:45:00.574
Man! Almost!


00:45:01.325 --> 00:45:03.827
We just about had it that time!


00:45:08.290 --> 00:45:09.792
Incredible.


00:45:10.376 --> 00:45:12.711
Well, not bad yourself.


00:45:22.513 --> 00:45:25.557
All this time,
you took after me.


00:45:26.475 --> 00:45:29.353
And where was I?


00:45:31.397 --> 00:45:33.732
I'm so sorry, Hiccup.


00:45:33.899 --> 00:45:36.568
Can we start over?


00:45:40.322 --> 00:45:41.990
Will you give me another chance?


00:45:45.786 --> 00:45:49.790
I can teach you all that I have
learned these past 20 years.


00:45:49.957 --> 00:45:51.667
Like...


00:45:56.130 --> 00:45:57.231
Wow.


00:45:57.256 --> 00:45:59.800
Now you can make
those tight turns.


00:46:02.553 --> 00:46:04.388
Did you know about this?


00:46:05.389 --> 00:46:08.350
Every dragon has its secrets.


00:46:08.517 --> 00:46:11.061
And I'll show them all to you.


00:46:11.228 --> 00:46:12.813
We'll unlock every mystery...


00:46:12.980 --> 00:46:15.899
find every last
species together...


00:46:16.066 --> 00:46:17.568
as mother and son.


00:46:22.739 --> 00:46:27.077
This gift we share,
Hiccup, it bonds us.


00:46:27.828 --> 00:46:31.039
This is who you are, son.


00:46:31.206 --> 00:46:32.749
Who we are.


00:46:32.916 --> 00:46:36.587
We will change the world
for all dragons.


00:46:36.753 --> 00:46:39.506
We will make it a better,
safer place.


00:46:39.673 --> 00:46:41.300
Yeah.


00:46:41.467 --> 00:46:43.552
That sounds amazing.


00:46:55.856 --> 00:46:57.691
This is so great!


00:46:57.858 --> 00:47:00.569
Now you and I can
go talk to Drago together.


00:47:00.736 --> 00:47:01.904
What?


00:47:02.488 --> 00:47:04.281
There's no talking to Drago.


00:47:04.448 --> 00:47:05.699
But we have to...
No.


00:47:05.824 --> 00:47:07.534
We must protect our own.


00:47:08.660 --> 00:47:10.704
Come on,
we should be getting back.


00:47:25.761 --> 00:47:29.056
Okay! Look, I got you here.
Now get this thing off me.


00:47:29.223 --> 00:47:31.099
Never take a toy from a dragon.


00:47:31.266 --> 00:47:33.994
Don't you know anything?


00:47:34.019 --> 00:47:36.563
Why does this
keep happening to me?


00:47:50.869 --> 00:47:52.496
What's down there?


00:47:54.289 --> 00:47:57.209
Large diameter bubbles,
massive lungs...


00:47:57.376 --> 00:47:59.503
cold water deep dweller.


00:47:59.670 --> 00:48:03.173
I'm thinking class five
leviathan, maybe six.


00:48:18.021 --> 00:48:19.706
Meatlug!
What's wrong, girl?


00:48:37.791 --> 00:48:39.835
Drago!


00:48:43.130 --> 00:48:44.506
Get off me!


00:48:46.466 --> 00:48:49.011
Always great
to see you, my friend!


00:48:49.177 --> 00:48:50.804
Keeping warm up here?


00:48:54.516 --> 00:48:57.244
As you can see,
I'm right on time


00:48:57.269 --> 00:48:58.729
with a new batch of dragons...


00:48:58.895 --> 00:49:00.063
just like I promised.


00:49:00.230 --> 00:49:01.898
He's waking up!


00:49:02.190 --> 00:49:03.275
Give me some backup, here!


00:49:05.152 --> 00:49:06.320
Drop the ropes!


00:49:39.603 --> 00:49:40.937
- Hookfang!
- Hey!


00:49:41.104 --> 00:49:42.439
What are you doing?


00:49:42.773 --> 00:49:46.443
You belong to me now.


00:49:47.903 --> 00:49:49.780
And as an added bonus...


00:49:49.946 --> 00:49:51.615
I also caught you their riders.


00:49:52.074 --> 00:49:54.117
No extra charge.
What?


00:49:54.284 --> 00:49:55.661
Are you kidding me?
Aw!


00:49:55.827 --> 00:49:57.621
But you were so perfect!


00:49:57.788 --> 00:50:00.165
Turns out, there is a whole
bunch of them out there.


00:50:02.793 --> 00:50:03.852
How many?


00:50:03.877 --> 00:50:05.712
Drago doesn't
have them after all.


00:50:06.505 --> 00:50:07.756
- How many?
- Hundreds.


00:50:07.923 --> 00:50:09.383
A whole island full!


00:50:09.758 --> 00:50:11.385
I wouldn't worry about it.


00:50:11.551 --> 00:50:14.680
My men are hunting
them down as we speak.


00:50:14.846 --> 00:50:17.683
They won't know where you're
hiding, I promise you that.


00:50:17.849 --> 00:50:19.893
Yes, they will.
They know we're missing...


00:50:20.060 --> 00:50:22.020
and they have tracking dragons.


00:50:22.187 --> 00:50:24.606
If you so much as touch us,
Hiccup is gonna kick...


00:50:24.773 --> 00:50:26.566
- Hiccup?
- He's not a problem.


00:50:26.733 --> 00:50:28.652
Really. Trust me.


00:50:28.819 --> 00:50:31.088
He's only the son
of Stoick the Vast,


00:50:31.113 --> 00:50:32.906
his heir to
the throne of Berk...


00:50:33.073 --> 00:50:36.576
and the greatest dragon master
this world has ever seen!


00:50:36.743 --> 00:50:38.620
Dragon master?


00:50:38.787 --> 00:50:42.165
I alone control the dragons!


00:50:42.332 --> 00:50:44.167
No.
Sorry.


00:50:44.835 --> 00:50:47.629
And unless you let
us go, right now...


00:50:48.213 --> 00:50:50.053
he will blast through here
on his Night Fury...


00:50:50.590 --> 00:50:54.094
and blow your entire fleet
of ships to splinters.


00:50:54.261 --> 00:50:55.701
Then they will be
crying like babies.


00:50:56.513 --> 00:50:57.572
Funny and beautiful.


00:50:57.597 --> 00:50:58.598
Good one, babe!


00:50:59.015 --> 00:51:01.226
Like babies, they always cry.


00:51:01.393 --> 00:51:02.936
Real tiny ones.


00:51:03.103 --> 00:51:07.607
First, there was one rider,
and now, all of Berk.


00:51:08.275 --> 00:51:10.485
And you led them to me!


00:51:12.112 --> 00:51:13.213
Drago!


00:51:13.238 --> 00:51:15.782
Stop all preparations!


00:51:15.949 --> 00:51:20.036
We must attack the dragon
riders' nest at once!


00:51:20.203 --> 00:51:23.832
We will take down their alpha!


00:51:23.999 --> 00:51:27.519
Then we will take Berk!


00:51:29.171 --> 00:51:30.272
Drago.


00:51:30.297 --> 00:51:31.798
And get rid of him.


00:51:32.591 --> 00:51:34.593
Drago, please, I...


00:51:39.848 --> 00:51:41.016
Stormfly!


00:51:45.604 --> 00:51:47.022
No!


00:51:58.742 --> 00:52:01.178
Well, bud, we can't wait around


00:52:01.203 --> 00:52:03.622
for Drago to attack this place.


00:52:03.789 --> 00:52:05.373
We've gotta find him first.


00:52:13.048 --> 00:52:14.758
Let's go.


00:52:16.051 --> 00:52:17.552
Easy now.


00:52:17.719 --> 00:52:19.554
Are you kidding me?
How did you get in here?


00:52:19.721 --> 00:52:21.121
The same way we
are getting you out.


00:52:21.264 --> 00:52:22.849
We?
All clear.


00:52:23.016 --> 00:52:24.059
Toothless, come.


00:52:24.309 --> 00:52:27.187
Wait. There's something
you need to know.


00:52:27.354 --> 00:52:28.594
Yeah, yeah, tell me on the way.


00:52:28.647 --> 00:52:31.525
This isn't an on-the-way
kind of update, actually.


00:52:31.691 --> 00:52:32.734
I've heard enough.


00:52:32.901 --> 00:52:35.529
More of the
earth-shattering-development variety.


00:52:35.695 --> 00:52:37.781
Yeah, just add it to the pile.


00:52:39.366 --> 00:52:43.553
Dad, unlike most surprises I spring
on you, this is one you'll like.


00:52:43.578 --> 00:52:44.596
I promise.


00:52:44.621 --> 00:52:46.623
You just have to
handle it delicately.


00:52:50.168 --> 00:52:53.688
You might want to take this one.


00:52:55.799 --> 00:52:57.050
Boy.


00:52:58.844 --> 00:52:59.903
Dad...


00:52:59.928 --> 00:53:02.430
could you put
the sword away, please?


00:53:14.442 --> 00:53:17.404
I know what you're
gonna say, Stoick.


00:53:18.321 --> 00:53:20.323
How could I have done this?


00:53:21.533 --> 00:53:23.285
Stayed away all of these years?


00:53:23.451 --> 00:53:25.370
And why did I not
come back to you?


00:53:25.537 --> 00:53:27.080
To our son?


00:53:28.832 --> 00:53:32.377
What sign did I have that
you could change, Stoick?


00:53:32.544 --> 00:53:34.546
That anyone on Berk could?


00:53:35.338 --> 00:53:38.717
I pleaded so many times
to stop the fighting...


00:53:38.884 --> 00:53:41.386
to find another answer,
but did any of you listen?


00:53:41.553 --> 00:53:43.388
This is why I never married.


00:53:43.555 --> 00:53:46.182
This and one other reason.


00:53:47.100 --> 00:53:50.520
I know that I left you
to raise Hiccup alone...


00:53:50.687 --> 00:53:53.356
but I thought he would be
better off without me.


00:53:53.773 --> 00:53:56.902
And I was wrong,
I see that now, but...


00:53:58.945 --> 00:54:01.114
Stop being so stoic, Stoick!


00:54:01.281 --> 00:54:02.490
Go on.


00:54:02.657 --> 00:54:05.535
Shout, scream, say something!


00:54:10.040 --> 00:54:13.710
You're as beautiful
as the day I lost you.


00:54:47.869 --> 00:54:49.262
Could this day get any worse?


00:54:49.287 --> 00:54:50.388
Let me see.


00:54:50.413 --> 00:54:53.291
We're gonna jump into freezing cold
water, and then die from drowning.


00:54:53.458 --> 00:54:54.876
Looks refreshing.


00:54:55.335 --> 00:54:57.087
Please, ladies first.


00:54:58.296 --> 00:55:01.174
You are a steaming
heap of dragon...


00:55:01.341 --> 00:55:02.926
Duck.


00:55:06.179 --> 00:55:07.197
Warn the others!


00:55:07.222 --> 00:55:08.848
Get them, you son of an Eret.


00:55:11.059 --> 00:55:12.060
Take that!


00:55:19.067 --> 00:55:20.527
Okay, I love you again.


00:55:21.277 --> 00:55:23.655
Pathetic.
You can still jump.


00:55:23.822 --> 00:55:26.758
So, are we going to save your dragons
and get out of here, or not?


00:55:27.993 --> 00:55:30.954
Check every trap.
They're here somewhere.


00:55:40.505 --> 00:55:42.732
Meatlug?


00:55:42.757 --> 00:55:44.592
Anyone coming?


00:55:44.759 --> 00:55:46.839
I don't know. You just keep
doing what you are doing.


00:55:47.470 --> 00:55:49.347
Keep cranking.


00:56:06.072 --> 00:56:09.034
Thank you for saving my life.


00:56:13.288 --> 00:56:15.081
Now let me return the favor.


00:56:16.166 --> 00:56:19.002
Mom, you'd never
even recognize it.


00:56:19.169 --> 00:56:22.464
Where we used to make weapons, we
now build saddles, wing-slings.


00:56:22.630 --> 00:56:24.799
We even fix dragon teeth!


00:56:24.966 --> 00:56:27.052
You wouldn't believe how
much everything's changed.


00:56:27.218 --> 00:56:29.804
Our son has changed
Berk for the better.


00:56:29.971 --> 00:56:31.598
I think we did well
with this one, Val.


00:56:31.765 --> 00:56:32.891
Thanks, Dad.


00:56:34.100 --> 00:56:35.994
I got it. I got it.


00:56:47.906 --> 00:56:50.950
I'm a little out of practice.


00:56:51.117 --> 00:56:52.911
Well, you know...


00:56:53.078 --> 00:56:55.705
- I didn't marry you for your cooking.
- I hope not.


00:56:55.872 --> 00:56:59.459
Her meatballs could kill more
beasts than a battle-axe.


00:56:59.626 --> 00:57:02.295
I've still got a few knocking
around in here.


00:57:02.462 --> 00:57:05.006
And once you move back in,
with all your dragons...


00:57:05.173 --> 00:57:07.300
Drago won't even stand a chance.


00:57:07.467 --> 00:57:09.219
Everything will be okay!


00:57:09.385 --> 00:57:13.098
Slow down, son.
It's a lot to take in.


00:57:13.556 --> 00:57:15.308
Gotcha.


00:57:22.941 --> 00:57:25.360
I love this one.


00:57:41.084 --> 00:57:43.253
Remember our song, Val?


00:57:44.671 --> 00:57:50.844
<i>I'll swim and
sail on savage seas</i>


00:57:52.595 --> 00:57:56.933
<i>With ne'er a fear of drowning</i>


00:57:58.685 --> 00:58:03.690
<i>And gladly ride
the waves of life</i>


00:58:05.400 --> 00:58:09.696
<i>If you will marry me</i>


00:58:11.990 --> 00:58:14.534
<i>No scorching sun</i>


00:58:14.701 --> 00:58:18.329
<i>Nor freezing cold Will stop...</i>


00:58:18.496 --> 00:58:21.875
<i>Will stop me on my journey</i>


00:58:22.041 --> 00:58:23.585
Sorry.


00:58:26.129 --> 00:58:31.718
<i>If you will
promise me your heart</i>


00:58:36.181 --> 00:58:38.016
<i>And love...</i>


00:58:43.521 --> 00:58:49.944
<i>And love me for eternity</i>


00:58:51.946 --> 00:58:53.656
<i>My dearest one</i>


00:58:53.823 --> 00:58:55.825
<i>My darling dear</i>


00:58:55.992 --> 00:59:00.038
<i>Your mighty words astound me</i>


00:59:00.205 --> 00:59:03.333
<i>But I've no need of mighty deeds</i>


00:59:03.499 --> 00:59:06.753
<i>When I feel your arms around me</i>


00:59:06.920 --> 00:59:09.255
<i>But I would bring
you rings of gold</i>


00:59:09.422 --> 00:59:10.690
<i>I'd even sing you poetry</i>


00:59:10.715 --> 00:59:11.716
Whoo!
Would you?


00:59:12.300 --> 00:59:14.469
<i>And I would keep
you from all harm</i>


00:59:14.636 --> 00:59:17.305
<i>If you would stay beside me</i>


00:59:17.472 --> 00:59:20.225
<i>I have no use for rings of gold</i>


00:59:20.391 --> 00:59:21.951
<i>I care not for your poetry</i>


00:59:21.976 --> 00:59:23.853
<i>I only want your hand to hold</i>


00:59:24.020 --> 00:59:26.105
<i>I only want you near me</i>


00:59:26.272 --> 00:59:27.774
<i>To love
and kiss, to sweetly hold</i>


00:59:27.941 --> 00:59:30.318
<i>For the dancing and the dreaming</i>


00:59:30.485 --> 00:59:32.503
<i>Through all life's
sorrows and delights</i>


00:59:32.528 --> 00:59:34.197
<i>I'll keep your love inside me</i>


00:59:34.364 --> 00:59:35.724
<i>I will swim and
sail on savage seas</i>


00:59:35.865 --> 00:59:37.867
<i>With ne'er a fear of drowning</i>


00:59:38.034 --> 00:59:39.994
<i>And gladly ride
the waves of life</i>


00:59:40.161 --> 00:59:42.222
<i>If you will marry me</i>


00:59:45.166 --> 00:59:46.184
<i>I'm still going</i>


00:59:46.209 --> 00:59:47.418
Gobber!
I'm done.


00:59:50.672 --> 00:59:53.424
I thought I would have to die before
we could have that dance again.


00:59:53.591 --> 00:59:56.094
No need for drastic measures.


00:59:56.886 --> 00:59:58.513
For you, my dear...


00:59:59.514 --> 01:00:01.057
anything.


01:00:02.267 --> 01:00:04.269
Will you come home, Val?


01:00:05.687 --> 01:00:08.273
Will you be my wife once again?


01:00:14.612 --> 01:00:17.240
We can be a family!
What do you say?


01:00:21.202 --> 01:00:22.787
Yes.


01:00:24.706 --> 01:00:26.874
Great!
I'll do the cooking.


01:00:29.210 --> 01:00:31.629
Thank Odin you
didn't listen to me, son.


01:00:31.796 --> 01:00:33.236
We never would
have found each other.


01:00:35.633 --> 01:00:37.135
Toothless?


01:00:40.972 --> 01:00:42.056
What's happening?


01:01:02.744 --> 01:01:04.120
No.


01:01:04.620 --> 01:01:05.621
Val?


01:01:05.788 --> 01:01:07.915
Val! It's all right,
it's all right.


01:01:08.082 --> 01:01:10.835
We're a team now.
What do you want to do?


01:01:11.002 --> 01:01:12.754
We have to save the dragons.


01:01:13.129 --> 01:01:15.506
Aye. You got it!
Come on, son.


01:01:38.446 --> 01:01:41.449
Whatever comes,
keep hitting the mountain.


01:01:42.116 --> 01:01:44.619
We need to draw the alpha out.


01:01:54.379 --> 01:01:55.838
Ready the traps!


01:02:11.479 --> 01:02:12.688
Surprise!


01:02:12.855 --> 01:02:14.315
Yeah!


01:02:14.482 --> 01:02:15.666
What?


01:02:15.691 --> 01:02:16.984
Whoa!


01:02:17.902 --> 01:02:19.695
Whoo! Whoo-hoo!


01:02:20.238 --> 01:02:22.532
You really are
full of surprises!


01:02:22.907 --> 01:02:23.908
Let's go!


01:02:24.033 --> 01:02:26.828
Dragon riders, coming through!


01:02:28.704 --> 01:02:29.705
Fire!


01:02:35.336 --> 01:02:36.337
Yeah!


01:02:41.717 --> 01:02:43.511
Cut them down!


01:02:44.887 --> 01:02:46.222
Whoa, whoa, whoa!


01:02:46.514 --> 01:02:49.392
Eret, son of Eret!


01:02:59.610 --> 01:03:00.862
Up, girl!


01:03:01.195 --> 01:03:03.406
Lean left, Eret!
That's it!


01:03:03.614 --> 01:03:05.091
Look out!


01:03:13.791 --> 01:03:15.626
Yeah, baby!


01:03:19.088 --> 01:03:20.756
Take them down!


01:03:20.923 --> 01:03:22.550
Heads up!


01:03:30.057 --> 01:03:31.726
Dragon master.


01:03:32.477 --> 01:03:34.228
Welcome aboard, dragon rider!


01:03:34.395 --> 01:03:36.063
Thanks, I think.


01:03:36.230 --> 01:03:37.565
Where have you been?


01:03:37.732 --> 01:03:40.651
You know, catching up with Mom.


01:03:52.413 --> 01:03:53.915
That's your mother?


01:03:54.081 --> 01:03:56.792
Now you know where I
get my dramatic flair.


01:04:01.797 --> 01:04:05.426
The alpha!
Now we have a fight!


01:04:19.190 --> 01:04:20.650
Come on, Toothless!


01:04:20.816 --> 01:04:23.027
Show them what you got, bud.


01:04:27.490 --> 01:04:28.491
That a boy!


01:04:41.837 --> 01:04:44.131
I've waited
a long time for this!


01:04:44.298 --> 01:04:46.342
You cannot take our dragons!


01:04:46.717 --> 01:04:48.302
They are controlled
by the alpha!


01:04:48.469 --> 01:04:51.364
Then it's a good thing
I brought a challenger.


01:05:14.495 --> 01:05:15.705
Another one?


01:05:16.163 --> 01:05:19.083
That is a class ten!
Class ten!


01:05:22.920 --> 01:05:23.980
No.


01:05:24.005 --> 01:05:25.982
Come on!
Take down the alpha!


01:05:45.610 --> 01:05:46.669
Thank you.


01:05:46.694 --> 01:05:47.945
For you, my dear...


01:05:48.279 --> 01:05:49.739
anything.


01:05:57.413 --> 01:05:59.206
Val, do you think
you can stop them?


01:05:59.373 --> 01:06:00.541
I'll do my best.


01:06:00.708 --> 01:06:01.917
Come on, Cloudjumper!


01:06:02.376 --> 01:06:03.377
You!


01:06:03.961 --> 01:06:05.963
I watched you burn!


01:06:06.130 --> 01:06:08.591
It takes more than a
little fire to kill me!


01:06:31.238 --> 01:06:32.490
Stoick!


01:06:53.094 --> 01:06:54.095
No!


01:06:57.014 --> 01:06:58.182
No!


01:07:19.453 --> 01:07:20.705
We have won.


01:07:20.871 --> 01:07:23.624
Now, finish her!


01:07:23.791 --> 01:07:25.142
No!


01:07:33.467 --> 01:07:34.677
Hold on!


01:07:34.844 --> 01:07:35.845
Skullcrusher, go!


01:07:37.054 --> 01:07:38.114
Come on, Gobber!


01:07:38.139 --> 01:07:40.307
Right behind you, Stoick!


01:07:43.018 --> 01:07:44.687
Whoa! Whoa!


01:07:59.660 --> 01:08:00.703
Stop!


01:08:02.830 --> 01:08:04.165
Stop!


01:08:10.337 --> 01:08:14.258
This is the great dragon master?


01:08:14.425 --> 01:08:17.094
The son of Stoick the Vast?


01:08:18.888 --> 01:08:21.766
What shame he must feel.


01:08:23.017 --> 01:08:26.395
All of this loss, and for what?


01:08:26.562 --> 01:08:28.105
To become unstoppable?


01:08:28.439 --> 01:08:30.357
To rule the world?


01:08:30.566 --> 01:08:34.111
Dragons are kind,
amazing creatures...


01:08:34.278 --> 01:08:36.113
that can bring people together.


01:08:38.073 --> 01:08:40.367
Or tear them apart.


01:08:42.870 --> 01:08:43.929
You see...


01:08:43.954 --> 01:08:47.917
I know what it is
to live in fear.


01:08:48.083 --> 01:08:50.753
To see my village burned...


01:08:50.920 --> 01:08:53.297
my family taken.


01:08:54.131 --> 01:08:56.550
But even as a boy...


01:08:57.051 --> 01:08:58.761
left with nothing...


01:08:59.386 --> 01:09:03.724
I vowed to rise above
the fear of dragons...


01:09:05.601 --> 01:09:08.270
and liberate
the people of this world.


01:09:08.437 --> 01:09:10.564
Then why a dragon army?


01:09:10.731 --> 01:09:15.069
Well, you need dragons
to conquer other dragons.


01:09:15.236 --> 01:09:18.781
Or maybe you need dragons
to conquer people.


01:09:18.948 --> 01:09:21.742
To control those
who follow you...


01:09:22.159 --> 01:09:23.911
and to get rid of
those who won't.


01:09:26.914 --> 01:09:28.624
Clever boy.


01:09:28.791 --> 01:09:31.418
The world wants peace.


01:09:31.585 --> 01:09:34.755
And we have the answer
back on Berk.


01:09:34.922 --> 01:09:36.507
Just let me show you.


01:09:37.007 --> 01:09:38.509
No!


01:09:38.676 --> 01:09:42.096
Let me show you!


01:09:49.937 --> 01:09:51.063
What in...


01:09:56.944 --> 01:09:58.112
Hiccup!


01:09:59.029 --> 01:10:00.389
Come on, Gobber!


01:10:00.990 --> 01:10:03.117
Okay, change of plan!


01:10:05.202 --> 01:10:08.664
No dragon can resist
the alpha's command.


01:10:08.831 --> 01:10:12.835
So, he who controls the alpha...


01:10:13.002 --> 01:10:15.546
controls them all.


01:10:19.508 --> 01:10:20.634
Toothless?


01:10:26.348 --> 01:10:28.642
Toothless, you okay, bud?
What's going on?


01:10:28.809 --> 01:10:30.644
Witness true strength.


01:10:32.813 --> 01:10:35.900
The strength of
will over others.


01:10:41.196 --> 01:10:42.323
In the face of it...


01:10:43.157 --> 01:10:45.743
you are nothing.


01:10:51.165 --> 01:10:52.583
What did he just tell you?


01:10:56.378 --> 01:10:58.005
Toothless, come on.


01:10:58.672 --> 01:10:59.752
What's the matter with you?


01:11:00.049 --> 01:11:01.175
No, no, no, no.
Come on.


01:11:01.342 --> 01:11:02.927
What are you doing?
Knock it off.


01:11:03.510 --> 01:11:05.387
Stop! Snap out of it!


01:11:12.853 --> 01:11:13.854
Toothless, no!


01:11:14.438 --> 01:11:15.522
Toothless!


01:11:19.526 --> 01:11:21.070
Don't!
Hiccup!


01:11:22.529 --> 01:11:23.572
Stop!


01:11:23.739 --> 01:11:25.699
Son!
Dad!


01:11:25.866 --> 01:11:26.909
No!


01:11:46.220 --> 01:11:47.262
No.


01:11:55.562 --> 01:11:56.772
Dad!


01:11:57.731 --> 01:11:58.774
Stoick!


01:12:02.403 --> 01:12:03.404
Dad.


01:12:03.904 --> 01:12:05.906
No, you...


01:12:18.669 --> 01:12:19.670
No.


01:12:28.971 --> 01:12:31.181
No, no, no.


01:12:53.203 --> 01:12:54.455
No! Get away from him!


01:12:56.331 --> 01:12:57.833
Go on! Get out of here!


01:12:58.500 --> 01:13:00.252
Get away!


01:13:02.004 --> 01:13:05.632
It's not his fault.
You know that.


01:13:12.014 --> 01:13:13.323
<i>Good dragons...</i>


01:13:13.348 --> 01:13:15.476
<i>under the control
of bad people...</i>


01:13:15.642 --> 01:13:16.785
Wait! Don't go.


01:13:16.810 --> 01:13:18.312
<i>...do bad things.</i>


01:13:38.499 --> 01:13:39.500
Come on!


01:13:41.001 --> 01:13:43.087
Gather the men
and meet me at Berk!


01:13:43.253 --> 01:13:44.713
Toothless!


01:13:44.880 --> 01:13:46.673
No, don't.


01:14:12.366 --> 01:14:14.785
May the Valkyries welcome you...


01:14:14.952 --> 01:14:18.539
and lead you through
Odin's great battlefield.


01:14:18.705 --> 01:14:22.042
May they sing your name
with love and fury...


01:14:22.209 --> 01:14:25.254
so that we might hear it rise
from the depths of Valhalla...


01:14:25.420 --> 01:14:28.215
and know that you have taken
your rightful place...


01:14:28.382 --> 01:14:30.425
at the table of kings.


01:14:32.052 --> 01:14:34.555
For a great man has fallen.


01:14:35.806 --> 01:14:38.976
A warrior.
A Chieftain.


01:14:39.143 --> 01:14:40.727
A father.


01:14:41.895 --> 01:14:43.397
A friend.


01:15:17.764 --> 01:15:19.600
I'm sorry, Dad.


01:15:32.613 --> 01:15:36.325
I'm not the chief
that you wanted me to be.


01:15:36.491 --> 01:15:40.287
And I'm not the peacekeeper
I thought I was.


01:15:41.955 --> 01:15:44.666
I don't know...


01:15:57.721 --> 01:16:00.307
You came early into this world.


01:16:00.474 --> 01:16:03.143
You were such a wee thing.


01:16:03.310 --> 01:16:06.313
So frail, so fragile.


01:16:06.480 --> 01:16:09.316
I feared you wouldn't make it.


01:16:11.026 --> 01:16:13.153
But your father...


01:16:13.820 --> 01:16:15.364
he never doubted.


01:16:16.657 --> 01:16:17.966
He always said


01:16:17.991 --> 01:16:20.661
you would become
the strongest of them all.


01:16:21.328 --> 01:16:23.247
And he was right.


01:16:24.665 --> 01:16:29.544
You have the heart of a chief
and a soul of a dragon.


01:16:29.711 --> 01:16:31.480
Only you can bring


01:16:31.505 --> 01:16:33.382
our worlds together.


01:16:34.383 --> 01:16:38.387
That is who you are, son.


01:16:52.025 --> 01:16:53.235
I...


01:16:54.361 --> 01:16:57.906
I was so afraid
of becoming my dad.


01:16:59.449 --> 01:17:02.411
Mostly because I
thought I never could.


01:17:02.577 --> 01:17:06.290
How do you become
someone that great?


01:17:06.456 --> 01:17:10.752
That brave?
That selfless?


01:17:13.922 --> 01:17:17.259
I guess you can only try.


01:17:24.057 --> 01:17:27.060
A chief protects his own.


01:17:30.314 --> 01:17:32.065
We are going back.


01:17:33.233 --> 01:17:34.985
With what?


01:17:35.152 --> 01:17:37.112
He took all the dragons.


01:17:37.487 --> 01:17:39.614
Not all of them.


01:17:50.334 --> 01:17:52.169
I don't want to die!


01:17:52.336 --> 01:17:53.628
We can't fly these things!


01:17:53.795 --> 01:17:55.130
Yeah, no kidding!


01:17:55.297 --> 01:17:56.898
Whoa!


01:17:58.925 --> 01:18:00.736
But won't that
Bewilderbeast just


01:18:00.761 --> 01:18:02.804
take control of these guys, too?


01:18:02.971 --> 01:18:05.766
They're babies.
They don't listen to anyone.


01:18:05.932 --> 01:18:07.934
Yeah! Just like us!


01:18:08.101 --> 01:18:11.146
This is very dangerous!


01:18:15.025 --> 01:18:19.029
Some might suggest
this is poorly conceived.


01:18:19.279 --> 01:18:21.281
It's a good thing
that I never listen.


01:18:22.824 --> 01:18:26.453
So what is your plan?


01:18:26.620 --> 01:18:29.790
Get Toothless back
and kick Drago's...


01:18:29.956 --> 01:18:31.041
Heads up!


01:18:31.833 --> 01:18:33.185
And that thing.


01:18:33.210 --> 01:18:34.669
Whoa...


01:18:56.858 --> 01:18:58.460
That's a good boy.


01:19:04.699 --> 01:19:06.368
Watch the furniture!


01:19:07.494 --> 01:19:09.162
Where are you going?


01:19:25.846 --> 01:19:28.849
Your chief is dead.


01:19:29.349 --> 01:19:30.559
Stoick?


01:19:31.518 --> 01:19:34.020
No one can protect you now.


01:19:49.244 --> 01:19:50.287
No.


01:19:51.079 --> 01:19:52.956
He took all the dragons!


01:19:54.791 --> 01:19:58.770
Distract the alpha. Try to
keep his focus off Toothless.


01:19:58.795 --> 01:20:00.046
How?


01:20:00.213 --> 01:20:02.048
Have you forgotten
who you're riding with?


01:20:02.215 --> 01:20:05.552
There isn't a dragon alive
that I can't wrangle!


01:20:05.719 --> 01:20:06.862
Except for this one!


01:20:06.887 --> 01:20:08.054
Amateur.


01:20:09.723 --> 01:20:11.057
Hey, look.
It's Hiccup!


01:20:17.772 --> 01:20:18.773
What?


01:20:33.163 --> 01:20:34.748
Keep them coming!


01:20:34.915 --> 01:20:36.458
Black sheep, baby!


01:20:47.594 --> 01:20:48.637
Ten points!


01:21:03.026 --> 01:21:04.486
I'm okay!


01:21:12.285 --> 01:21:15.580
You certainly are hard to
get rid of, I'll say that.


01:21:15.747 --> 01:21:17.040
Toothless?


01:21:18.375 --> 01:21:19.709
Hey...


01:21:19.876 --> 01:21:21.545
it's me, bud.


01:21:22.128 --> 01:21:23.129
It's me.


01:21:23.380 --> 01:21:25.298
It's me.
I'm right here, bud.


01:21:26.049 --> 01:21:27.609
Come back to me.


01:21:29.427 --> 01:21:32.097
He's not yours anymore.


01:21:32.264 --> 01:21:34.099
He belongs to the alpha.


01:21:34.266 --> 01:21:37.727
But, please,
great dragon master...


01:21:37.894 --> 01:21:40.230
try to take him.


01:21:40.397 --> 01:21:43.817
He will not miss a second time.


01:21:44.234 --> 01:21:45.986
It wasn't your fault, bud.


01:21:47.571 --> 01:21:49.948
They made you do it.


01:21:59.457 --> 01:22:01.793
You would never hurt him.


01:22:06.089 --> 01:22:08.633
You would never hurt me.


01:22:11.845 --> 01:22:13.847
How are you doing that?


01:22:14.014 --> 01:22:15.031
Please.


01:22:15.056 --> 01:22:17.183
You are my best friend, bud.


01:22:21.438 --> 01:22:23.273
My best friend.


01:22:28.862 --> 01:22:30.530
Atta boy! That's it!


01:22:30.989 --> 01:22:32.007
I'm here!


01:22:32.032 --> 01:22:33.199
Enough!


01:22:39.998 --> 01:22:41.207
Hang on!


01:22:45.879 --> 01:22:47.047
Almost there, buddy.


01:22:57.641 --> 01:22:59.142
Do something!


01:22:59.309 --> 01:23:01.186
We need to get those two apart.


01:23:12.072 --> 01:23:14.240
We have to block
him out, Toothless.


01:23:14.407 --> 01:23:16.409
Do you trust me, bud?


01:23:18.370 --> 01:23:20.163
We can do this.


01:23:20.747 --> 01:23:22.749
You and me.


01:23:22.916 --> 01:23:24.084
As one.


01:23:26.836 --> 01:23:27.896
That's it.


01:23:27.921 --> 01:23:30.423
Now let's try
this one more time!


01:23:32.425 --> 01:23:34.219
Take him down, babe!


01:23:37.889 --> 01:23:39.015
Go get them!


01:23:41.434 --> 01:23:42.727
Take control of it!


01:23:45.355 --> 01:23:46.523
Shut it out, Toothless.


01:23:46.690 --> 01:23:48.274
Stop them!
Now!


01:24:11.589 --> 01:24:12.632
Not again.


01:24:14.884 --> 01:24:16.970
Toothless!
It's now or never!


01:24:20.265 --> 01:24:21.599
Come on, bud!


01:24:23.476 --> 01:24:24.602
Hold on!


01:24:27.731 --> 01:24:29.482
Yeah! We did it!


01:24:38.658 --> 01:24:40.785
Hold him there, Toothless.


01:24:41.077 --> 01:24:42.954
It's all over now.


01:24:44.748 --> 01:24:46.166
Or is it?


01:24:49.502 --> 01:24:50.603
No!


01:24:59.345 --> 01:25:00.346
No!


01:25:02.432 --> 01:25:03.433
No!


01:25:11.608 --> 01:25:12.917
Hiccup!


01:25:43.848 --> 01:25:45.225
He's challenging the alpha!


01:25:45.391 --> 01:25:47.018
To protect you.


01:26:12.752 --> 01:26:14.754
No, no, no! No!


01:26:15.880 --> 01:26:17.715
Fight back! Fight!


01:26:17.882 --> 01:26:19.259
Fight!


01:26:21.594 --> 01:26:24.013
What's the matter with you?


01:26:34.107 --> 01:26:35.441
Now do you get it?


01:26:35.608 --> 01:26:39.003
This is what it is to
earn a dragon's loyalty.


01:26:40.947 --> 01:26:42.740
Let this end. Now.


01:26:43.283 --> 01:26:44.450
Never!


01:26:44.617 --> 01:26:45.618
Come on!


01:27:08.474 --> 01:27:09.976
Fight!


01:27:43.509 --> 01:27:46.070
The alpha protects them all.


01:28:45.738 --> 01:28:48.366
You never cease
to amaze me, bud.


01:28:49.325 --> 01:28:50.827
Thank you.


01:28:53.538 --> 01:28:56.207
Toothless, you know
that doesn't wash out!


01:28:58.710 --> 01:29:00.837
I knew you'd come back!


01:29:03.506 --> 01:29:04.549
Stormfly!


01:29:07.552 --> 01:29:09.929
Give me a cuddle, Grumpy!


01:29:13.725 --> 01:29:15.268
Who's my little princess?


01:29:15.601 --> 01:29:17.186
Don't you ever
leave again, Hookfang.


01:29:17.353 --> 01:29:19.772
You are! Yes, you are!
I missed you!


01:29:20.106 --> 01:29:21.107
Barf!


01:29:21.274 --> 01:29:22.942
Not you!


01:29:25.278 --> 01:29:28.614
That was some pretty fine
dragon wrangling back there.


01:29:28.781 --> 01:29:30.508
You'd make a good trapper.


01:29:30.533 --> 01:29:32.010
Whoa!


01:29:32.035 --> 01:29:35.221
You know, Skullcrusher's
gonna need somebody


01:29:35.246 --> 01:29:36.372
to look after him now.


01:29:37.123 --> 01:29:38.124
Me?


01:29:42.378 --> 01:29:43.588
I'd be honored.


01:29:45.798 --> 01:29:49.761
Your father would be
every bit as proud as I am.


01:29:49.927 --> 01:29:51.387
Thank you.


01:29:51.554 --> 01:29:53.431
I'm really glad
you're here, Mom.


01:29:53.598 --> 01:29:55.641
And here I'll stay.


01:29:57.143 --> 01:29:58.478
See?


01:29:58.644 --> 01:30:00.271
I told you it was in here.


01:30:02.482 --> 01:30:05.485
Still doing that one?
That's hilarious.


01:30:05.651 --> 01:30:07.170
Come here, you.


01:30:08.362 --> 01:30:09.363
Ooh!


01:30:39.811 --> 01:30:42.080
The chief has come home!


01:30:48.694 --> 01:30:51.005
Long live the chief!


01:30:51.030 --> 01:30:55.201
Long live the chief!
Long live the chief!


01:31:08.047 --> 01:31:09.465
Yeah!


01:31:20.059 --> 01:31:22.061
<i>This is Berk.</i>


01:31:22.895 --> 01:31:25.231
<i>A bit trampled and busted
and covered in ice...</i>


01:31:25.398 --> 01:31:27.150
<i>but it's home.</i>


01:31:27.316 --> 01:31:28.901
<i>It's our home.</i>


01:31:33.072 --> 01:31:35.908
<i>Those who attacked us
are relentless and crazy.</i>


01:31:36.993 --> 01:31:38.886
<i>But those who stopped them...</i>


01:31:38.911 --> 01:31:41.289
<i>even more so!</i>


01:31:43.916 --> 01:31:45.918
<i>We may be small in numbers...</i>


01:31:46.085 --> 01:31:47.420
<i>but we stand for something...</i>


01:31:47.587 --> 01:31:50.840
<i>bigger than anything
the world can pit against us.</i>


01:31:51.841 --> 01:31:54.010
<i>We are the voice of peace.</i>


01:31:54.218 --> 01:31:57.263
<i>And, bit by bit,
we will change this world.</i>


01:32:06.439 --> 01:32:08.941
<i>You see, we have
something they don't.</i>


01:32:09.233 --> 01:32:10.568
<i>Sure, they have armies...</i>


01:32:11.277 --> 01:32:13.738
<i>and they have armadas...</i>


01:32:14.363 --> 01:32:16.199
<i>but we have...</i>


01:32:17.742 --> 01:32:19.594
<i>our dragons!</i>


01:32:22.496 --> 01:32:24.182
<i>Let the wind carry us</i>


01:32:24.207 --> 01:32:26.959
<i>To the clouds,
hurry up, all right</i>


01:32:29.337 --> 01:32:31.063
<i>We can travel so far</i>


01:32:31.088 --> 01:32:34.383
<i>As our eyes can see</i>


01:32:36.177 --> 01:32:42.141
<i>We go where no one goes</i>


01:32:43.017 --> 01:32:46.954
<i>We slow for no one</i>


01:32:46.979 --> 01:32:48.789
<i>Get out...</i>


01:32:48.814 --> 01:32:51.567
<i>...of our way</i>


01:33:15.841 --> 01:33:17.568
<i>Awake in the sky</i>


01:33:17.593 --> 01:33:20.346
<i>We break up so high, all right</i>


01:33:22.723 --> 01:33:24.450
<i>Let's make it our own</i>


01:33:24.475 --> 01:33:27.311
<i>Let's savor it</i>


01:33:29.355 --> 01:33:34.502
<i>We go where no one goes</i>


01:33:34.527 --> 01:33:38.406
<i>We slow for no one</i>


01:33:40.116 --> 01:33:44.120
<i>Get out of our way</i>


01:34:03.597 --> 01:34:08.728
<i>We slow for no one</i>


01:34:10.146 --> 01:34:15.860
<i>We go where no one goes</i>


01:34:17.028 --> 01:34:22.033
<i>We slow for no one</i>


01:34:23.826 --> 01:34:30.725
<i>We go where no one goes</i>


01:34:30.750 --> 01:34:37.590
<i>We go where no one goes</i>

